prompts.emitter:
Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: transparent 2D side-view sprite atlas for ORDRE DE CENDRE, an original grounded military science-fiction game. Exactly FIVE isolated states of ONE alien Khelt resonance emitter, in a 3 columns by 2 rows grid on 1536x1024. The final bottom-right cell must stay completely transparent and empty. Cells are 512x512. Top row 3 objects, bottom row first2 objects only. No grid borders, no captions, no writing, no people, no scenery, no ground plane, no independent glow halo or cast shadow.
Subject: a sophisticated constructed Khelt civic warning instrument, made of pale sage mineral ceramic, fibrous brackets and tarnished metal couplings. One tall central curved resonance spine, a visible central circular resonator, four narrower tuned ribs at its sides, braces actually connecting those ribs, broad low root-like anchoring foot, and a thick cable coupling that connects to its lower right. A coherent designed machine, no magical crystal pile, no weapons. Hand-painted detailed surfaces, restrained ivory/green palette and small muted mint light, physically readable orthographic side view, no perspective into a diorama.
Cell order left to right then down:
1 transmitting, complete instrument with steady central resonance light;
2 working, same complete structure with lower service cover open and connected maintenance coupling, no progress bar;
3 seized, ONLY the original broad anchoring base, exposed empty mounting socket and disconnected cable drooping onto the base: the tall resonance spine and all ribs have been removed, not lying nearby;
4 preserved, complete structure reconnected, reinforced lower coupling, quiet warm pale green resonator;
5 destroyed, shattered central spine and bent broken ribs collapsing onto the original base, dark resonator, connected identifiable debris, no flames or particles.
Object scale and base footprint identical for all five cells, intact roughly370px high, base about360px wide, contact baseline at455px within eachcell, generous transparent margins. Seized and ruined states remain genuinely shorter; DO NOT enlarge them to fill their cells. Preserve ground contact and same construction. True transparent background.
